    {
      "id": "operator-operator-capstone-service-logs-lesson",
      "slug": "service-logs",
      "title": "Capstone: local service и logs",
      "type": "theory",
      "order": 5,
      "category": "troubleshooting",
      "concept": "capstone_service_logs",
      "version": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Capstone: local service и logs"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Symptom: health endpoint недоступен, а в нескольких logs повторяются failures. Свяжите listener owner, request и error records, затем сформируйте summary."
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "bash",
          "code": "mkdir -p evidence; ss -lntp >evidence/sockets.txt; grep -R -n 'ERROR' logs >evidence/errors.txt"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Цель: Соберите socket и log evidence в отдельный каталог.",
            "Проверка: Transport и application evidence нельзя смешивать в одну гипотезу."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "tone": "warning",
          "text": "Transport и application evidence нельзя смешивать в одну гипотезу."
        }
      ],
      "completion": {
        "explicitContinue": true
      }
    },
